//! The `translate` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property allows you to
//! specify translation transforms individually and independently of the `transform` property. This
//! maps better to typical user interface usage, and saves having to remember the exact order of
//! transform functions to specify in the `transform` value.
//!
//! Initial: none. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: refer to the size of bounding box.
//!
